{"type":"text","timestamp":1790388853745,"sessionID":"ses_f2489bdd3ffeKkqP11CI1Qff0N","part":{"id":"prt_0db7ddbdd00131Us1zc31eKeYJ","messageID":"msg_0db7db3cb001IboP2wo1jLD0GP","sessionID":"ses_f2489bdd3ffeKkqP11CI1Qff0N","type":"text","text":"The visual capture confirms the game still renders correctly. I’m doing one final targeted runtime assertion against the instantiated player: idle attack selects `ATTACK`, walking attack selects `KICK` with zero velocity, and the kick animation contains frames 40–45 plus the required damage and callback tracks.","time":{"start":1790388853725,"end":1790388853727},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0c81d411bfcdd66a016ab72a750328819695decfaadd8df3bc","phase":"commentary"}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790388853745,"sessionID":"ses_f2489bdd3ffeKkqP11CI1Qff0N","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_Qug09QwDqSRwZVQyujESIlXw","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: /workspace/kick_verification.gd\n+extends SceneTree\n+\n+func _initialize() -> void:\n+\tvar player := load(\"res://scenes/characters/player.tscn\").instantiate() as Player\n+\troot.add_child(player)\n+\tplayer.process_mode = Node.PROCESS_MODE_DISABLED\n+\n+\tInput.action_press(\"attack\")\n+\tplayer.handle_input()\n+\tassert(player.state == Character.State.ATTACK, \"Idle attack did not select punch\")\n+\tInput.action_release(\"attack\")\n+\tawait process_frame\n+\n+\tplayer.set_state(Character.State.WALK)\n+\tplayer.velocity = Vector2(player.speed, 0.0)\n+\tInput.action_press(\"attack\")\n+\tplayer.handle_input()\n+\tassert(player.state == Character.State.KICK, \"Walking attack did not select kick\")\n+\tassert(player.velocity == Vector2.ZERO, \"Kick did not stop horizontal movement\")\n+\tInput.action_release(\"attack\")\n+\n+\tvar kick := player.animation_player.get_animation(\"kick\")\n+\tassert(kick != null, \"Kick animation is missing\")\n+\tassert(kick.track_get_key_value(0, 0) == 40)\n+\tassert(kick.track_get_key_value(0, 5) == 45)\n+\tassert(kick.track_get_path(2) == NodePath(\"DamageEmitter:monitoring\"))\n+\tassert(kick.track_get_key_value(2, 0) == false)\n+\tassert(kick.track_get_key_value(2, 1) == true)\n+\tassert(kick.track_get_key_value(2, 2) == false)\n+\tassert(kick.method_track_get_name(1, 0) == &\"on_action_complete\")\n+\n+\tprint(\"Kick verification passed\")\n+\tquit()\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA workspace/kick_verification.gd","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /workspace/kick_verification.gd\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/kick_verification.gd\n+++ /workspace/kick_verification.gd\n@@ -0,0 +1,33 @@\n+extends SceneTree\n+\n+func _initialize() -> void:\n+\tvar player := load(\"res://scenes/characters/player.tscn\").instantiate() as Player\n+\troot.add_child(player)\n+\tplayer.process_mode = Node.PROCESS_MODE_DISABLED\n+\n+\tInput.action_press(\"attack\")\n+\tplayer.handle_input()\n+\tassert(player.state == Character.State.ATTACK, \"Idle attack did not select punch\")\n+\tInput.action_release(\"attack\")\n+\tawait process_frame\n+\n+\tplayer.set_state(Character.State.WALK)\n+\tplayer.velocity = Vector2(player.speed, 0.0)\n+\tInput.action_press(\"attack\")\n+\tplayer.handle_input()\n+\tassert(player.state == Character.State.KICK, \"Walking attack did not select kick\")\n+\tassert(player.velocity == Vector2.ZERO, \"Kick did not stop horizontal movement\")\n+\tInput.action_release(\"attack\")\n+\n+\tvar kick := player.animation_player.get_animation(\"kick\")\n+\tassert(kick != null, \"Kick animation is missing\")\n+\tassert(kick.track_get_key_value(0, 0) == 40)\n+\tassert(kick.track_get_key_value(0, 5) == 45)\n+\tassert(kick.track_get_path(2) == NodePath(\"DamageEmitter:monitoring\"))\n+\tassert(kick.track_get_key_value(2, 0) == false)\n+\tassert(kick.track_get_key_value(2, 1) == true)\n+\tassert(kick.track_get_key_value(2, 2) == false)\n+\tassert(kick.method_track_get_name(1, 0) == &\"on_action_complete\")\n+\n+\tprint(\"Kick verification passed\")\n+\tquit()\n\n","files":[{"filePath":"/workspace/kick_verification.gd","relativePath":"workspace/kick_verification.gd","type":"add","patch":"Index: /workspace/kick_verification.gd\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/kick_verification.gd\n+++ /workspace/kick_verification.gd\n@@ -0,0 +1,33 @@\n+extends SceneTree\n+\n+func _initialize() -> void:\n+\tvar player := load(\"res://scenes/characters/player.tscn\").instantiate() as Player\n+\troot.add_child(player)\n+\tplayer.process_mode = Node.PROCESS_MODE_DISABLED\n+\n+\tInput.action_press(\"attack\")\n+\tplayer.handle_input()\n+\tassert(player.state == Character.State.ATTACK, \"Idle attack did not select punch\")\n+\tInput.action_release(\"attack\")\n+\tawait process_frame\n+\n+\tplayer.set_state(Character.State.WALK)\n+\tplayer.velocity = Vector2(player.speed, 0.0)\n+\tInput.action_press(\"attack\")\n+\tplayer.handle_input()\n+\tassert(player.state == Character.State.KICK, \"Walking attack did not select kick\")\n+\tassert(player.velocity == Vector2.ZERO, \"Kick did not stop horizontal movement\")\n+\tInput.action_release(\"attack\")\n+\n+\tvar kick := player.animation_player.get_animation(\"kick\")\n+\tassert(kick != null, \"Kick animation is missing\")\n+\tassert(kick.track_get_key_value(0, 0) == 40)\n+\tassert(kick.track_get_key_value(0, 5) == 45)\n+\tassert(kick.track_get_path(2) == NodePath(\"DamageEmitter:monitoring\"))\n+\tassert(kick.track_get_key_value(2, 0) == false)\n+\tassert(kick.track_get_key_value(2, 1) == true)\n+\tassert(kick.track_get_key_value(2, 2) == false)\n+\tassert(kick.method_track_get_name(1, 0) == &\"on_action_complete\")\n+\n+\tprint(\"Kick verification passed\")\n+\tquit()\n","additions":33,"deletions":0}],"diagnostics":{},"truncated":false},"title":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA workspace/kick_verification.gd","time":{"start":1790388853732,"end":1790388853734}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_0c81d411bfcdd66a016ab72a75305c8196a86f2ef5f7228e93"}},"id":"prt_0db7ddbe0001A8gbYWvbfWLTaO","sessionID":"ses_f2489bdd3ffeKkqP11CI1Qff0N","messageID":"msg_0db7db3cb001IboP2wo1jLD0GP"}}
